THIRD-PARTY DATA AND MODELS

This licence covers the code and analyses in this repository. It does not and
cannot relicense material produced by others, which is redistributed here for
reproducibility and remains under its own terms:

  data/external/trap_pathogenic_db.csv
      Curated pathogenic epitope set from TRAP (Lee et al., Genome Medicine
      2023), github.com/ChloeHJ/TRAP.

  data/external/bigmhc_im_*.csv
      Predictions from, and the immunogenicity training set of, BigMHC
      (Albert et al., Nature Machine Intelligence 2023), Mendeley
      10.17632/dvmz6pkzvb.

  data/external/mixmhcpred_*.csv
      Predictions from MixMHCpred 3.0 (Gfeller lab). MixMHCpred is free for
      academic use; commercial use requires a licence from the Ludwig
      Institute for Cancer Research.

  data/external/deepimmuno_train.csv, models/CNN_WEIGHT_OPSI
      Training pairs and the released checkpoint of DeepImmuno (Li et al.,
      Briefings in Bioinformatics 2021), github.com/frankligy/DeepImmuno.

  data/raw/, data/processed/
      Derived from the Immune Epitope Database (IEDB), which is free to use
      with attribution; see iedb.org.

Cite the original work when you use any of these.
